Hi Laura,

I have attached ABS-2026-EX-001 v0.1, a draft bringing together sixteen topics for the Application Desk R7 change explanation. Could you review the English by 11 May?

In particular, please look at whether the wording distinguishes receipt of an application from completion of the underlying work. I would also appreciate your reading of places where instructions for someone using the screen may be mixed with operational investigation. The draft currently puts both in one candidate user notice, and I am concerned that it may ask the wrong reader to take an action.

This is an editorial review of the draft, not a request to approve implementation or publication. The proposed changes and the publication decision remain open.

Thank you,
Miyu


